flowchart LR
    B[Approved brief and lab limits] --> P[Revise working agenda]
    P --> C[Propose next operation or small batch]
    C --> V[Validate and bind exact invocation]
    V --> E[Execute and observe]
    E --> Q[Independent checks and acceptance]
    Q --> K[Retain result and update knowledge]
    K --> P
    Q -->|failure or inconclusive| P
    N[New eligible CC version or user direction] --> P
